<title>USA: McGraw-Hill, FactSet enter alliance.</title>
<headline>McGraw-Hill, FactSet enter alliance.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>DRI/McGraw-Hill and FactSet Research Systems Inc said on Monday that DRI/McGraw-Hill economic and financial data will be available on FactSet at the end of the first quarter 1997.</p>
<p>Initially, the DRI economic and financial data carried on FactSet will represent over 50 economies including emerging markets in Asia, Eastern Europe and Latin America, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>FactSet and DRI, a unit of McGraw-Hill Cos Inc, said the alliance combines DRI's financial data with FactSet's database services.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
